        "accession_number": "0001364250-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through our interest in our Operating Partnership, its subsidiaries, and our consolidated JVs, we focus on owning, acquiring, developing and managing a substantial market share of top-tier office properties and premier multifamily communities in neighborhoods with significant supply constraints, high-end executive housing and key lifestyle amenities.",
